---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Today's Bible Verse">
	<article class="privacy-policy">
		<header>
			<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p>Effective date: August 24, 2026</p>
		</header>

		<p>
			Today’s Bible Verse respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how information
			is handled when you use the Today’s Bible Verse mobile application or website.
		</p>

		<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
		<p>
			The Today’s Bible Verse mobile application does not require an account and does not
			collect, store, or share personal information.
		</p>
		<p>
			The app does not collect names, email addresses, location data, contacts, browsing
			activity, advertising identifiers, or payment information.
		</p>

		<h2>App Preferences</h2>
		<p>
			Preferences such as reading-reminder settings are stored locally on your device. This
			information is not transmitted to Today’s Bible Verse or stored on our servers.
		</p>
		<p>
			You can remove locally stored app information by clearing the app’s data or uninstalling
			the app.
		</p>

		<h2>Notifications</h2>
		<p>
			If you enable reading reminders, the app asks for permission to send notifications.
			Reminder preferences and scheduling are managed locally by your device.
		</p>
		<p>
			You can change or disable notifications at any time through the app or your device
			settings.
		</p>

		<h2>Analytics, Advertising, and Tracking</h2>
		<p>The app does not use third-party advertising, behavioral tracking, or analytics services.</p>

		<h2>Website</h2>
		<p>
			The Today’s Bible Verse website does not require an account or intentionally collect
			personal information.
		</p>
		<p>
			The website’s hosting provider may automatically process limited technical information,
			such as IP addresses and request logs, to deliver and secure the website. This information
			is handled according to the hosting provider’s privacy practices.
		</p>
		<p>
			If you contact us by email, we receive the email address and information you choose to
			provide. We use that information only to respond to your message.
		</p>

		<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
		<p>
			The app may be downloaded through Apple’s App Store and Google Play. Apple and Google may
			process information independently under their respective privacy policies.
		</p>
		<p>
			Links to third-party websites or services are governed by those services’ own privacy
			policies.
		</p>

		<h2>Children’s Privacy</h2>
		<p>
			Today’s Bible Verse does not knowingly collect personal information from children. The app
			does not require an account or request personal information from its users.
		</p>

		<h2>Data Retention and Deletion</h2>
		<p>
			Because the app does not collect personal information, Today’s Bible Verse does not
			maintain personal user records to retain or delete.
		</p>
		<p>
			Information included in an email inquiry may be retained for as long as reasonably
			necessary to respond and maintain appropriate support records. You may request deletion of
			an email correspondence by contacting us.
		</p>

		<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
		<p>
			We may update this Privacy Policy if the app, website, or our data practices change.
			Updates will be posted on this page with a revised effective date.
		</p>

		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<p>
			For questions or requests concerning this Privacy Policy, contact{' '}
			<a href="mailto:todaysbibleverse.inquiry@gmail.com">
				todaysbibleverse.inquiry@gmail.com
			</a>.
		</p>
	</article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.privacy-policy {
		max-width: 48rem;
		margin-inline: auto;
		padding: 10.5rem 0 3rem;
		font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
	}

	.privacy-policy header {
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
	}

	.privacy-policy h1 {
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
		font-size: 1.75rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.privacy-policy h2 {
		margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.privacy-policy p {
		color: #d0d0d0;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.privacy-policy a {
		color: #ffffff;
		text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
	}

	@media (max-width: 48rem) {
		.privacy-policy {
			padding-top: 8.4rem;
		}
	}
</style>
